## Intellectual Property Notice

The **composition operator C**, the **Governance Manifold Hypothesis**,
and the **Tensor Volume Layer (L3)** theoretical framework were conceived
and formalized by Juan Pablo Chancay as part of the CAL research program.

This repository serves as a timestamped public record of the original
contribution, establishing intellectual priority prior to formal academic
publication.

- CAL pre-paper: DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20430343 (May 2026)
- Repository: <https://github.com/jpcpol/Tensor-Volume-Layer-L3>

